  "body": "Enjoy the best of Long Bay living in this modern, free-standing home, offering comfort, convenience and a low-maintenance lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe home features three well-proportioned bedrooms, two bathrooms plus a separate toilet, and a light-filled open-plan living and dining area. The modern kitchen connects seamlessly with the living space, making everyday living and entertaining easy. An internal-access garage adds to the home's practical appeal.\r\n\r\nProperty features:\r\n- Two bathrooms plus a separate toilet\r\n- Modern kitchen and open-plan living and dining\r\n- Internal-access garage\r\n- Freehold title\r\n- Close to Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Village, scenic walking tracks and nature reserves.\r\n\r\nLocation is another key advantage. Long Bay Village is within walking distance, with New World, cafes, a gym and other everyday amenities close by. Long Bay Beach, the Regional Park and scenic walking tracks are also nearby, making it easy to enjoy the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nZoned for Long Bay School and Long Bay College, this is a great option for first-home buyers, young families or investors looking for a well-located property in a popular North Shore community.\r\n\r\nMake the most of what Long Bay has to offer. Get in touch today to arrange a viewing.",
